            "data": {
                "text": "## 1. Inputs and controls\n\nSupply the quality-trimmed, host-removed paired short reads first, then the optional nanopore and PacBio reads. Choose the assembler (custom assemblies must follow the selected samples), how samples are grouped, which coverage strategy to run, which binners to enable, and the refinement and MAG selection settings."
