                            2870,
                            260
                        ],
                        "data": {
                            "text": "## Select original or grouped long reads\n\nEnable original reads, metadata-based grouping, or both for hybrid mode. Fastq groupmerge merges long-read files using the selected metadata column. Optional bridges, merging and null filtering return the chosen samples. Empty sample-matched fallbacks preserve structure when long reads are absent; they are removed before assembly."
                        }
                    },
